    <item>
      <title>Midea Air Conditioner</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/midea/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/midea/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;midea&lt;/code&gt; component creates a Midea air conditioner climate device.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;alert alert-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;alert-heading&#34;&gt;&#xA;    ℹ️&#xA;    &#xA;    Note&#xA;    &#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;This protocol also used by some vendors:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.electrolux.ru/&#34;&gt;Electrolux&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.qlima.com/&#34;&gt;Qlima&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.artelgroup.com/&#34;&gt;Artel&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.carrier.com/&#34;&gt;Carrier&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.comfee-russia.ru/&#34;&gt;Comfee&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.inventorairconditioner.com/&#34;&gt;Inventor&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://senville.com/&#34;&gt;Senville&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;and maybe others&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Control is possible with a custom dongle. Example of hardware implementation is &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/dudanov/iot-uni-dongle&#34;&gt;IoT Uni Dongle&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;https://smartlight.me/smart-home-devices/wifi-devices/wifi-dongle-air-conditioners-midea-idea-electrolux-for-home-assistant&#34;&gt;Midea SLWF-01pro&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&#34;https://cloudfree.shop/product/ductless-hvac-wi-fi-module/&#34;&gt;CloudFree&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.tindie.com/products/smartlightme/wifi-dongle-for-air-conditioners-midea-electrolux&#34;&gt;Tindie&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>PID Climate</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/pid/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/pid/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;pid&lt;/code&gt; climate platform allows you to regulate a value with a&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller&#34;&gt;PID controller&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;PID controllers are good at modulating an output signal to get a sensor reading to a specified&#xA;setpoint. For example, it can be used to modulate the power of a heating unit to get the&#xA;temperature to a user-specified setpoint.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;alert alert-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;alert-heading&#34;&gt;&#xA;    ℹ️&#xA;    &#xA;    Note&#xA;    &#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;PID is like cruise control in the cars: it keeps the car&amp;rsquo;s speed constant by continuously&#xA;adjusting the fuel quantity, based on load measurements. Eg when the car has to go up on a hill,&#xA;the system notices the load increase thus immediately gives more fuel to the engine; and when it&#xA;goes down on the other side of the hill, it notices the load decrease thus reduces or cuts off fuel&#xA;completely so that car speed remains as constant as possible. The calculation takes in consideration&#xA;constants like car weight, wind resistance etc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Thermostat Climate Controller</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/thermostat/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/thermostat/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;thermostat&lt;/code&gt; climate platform allows you to control a climate control system in much the same manner as a&#xA;physical thermostat. Its operation is similar to the &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/climate/bang_bang/&#34;&gt;Bang-Bang&lt;/a&gt; controller; a sensor measures a value&#xA;(the air temperature) and the controller will try to keep this value within a range defined by the set point(s). To do this,&#xA;the controller can activate devices like a heating unit and/or a cooling unit to change the value observed by the sensor.&#xA;When configured for both heating and cooling, it is essentially two &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/climate/bang_bang/&#34;&gt;Bang-Bang&lt;/a&gt; controllers in one; it&#xA;differs, however, in that interaction with the thermostat component is nearly identical to that of a real thermostat.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tuya Climate</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/climate/tuya/</link>
